1
00:00:32,299 --> 00:00:36,299
Heavy eyes... gray morning light.

2
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:42,759
Clothes untouched... after the storm.

3
00:00:42,799 --> 00:00:48,000
No one used... the dark tonight.

4
00:00:48,299 --> 00:00:54,399
Safe beneath... the woolen sheet.

5
00:00:55,200 --> 00:01:00,500
You didn't run... when darkness broke.

6
00:01:00,799 --> 00:01:06,079
You stayed to guard... through fear and pain.

7
00:01:06,209 --> 00:01:11,359
No taking what was lost in me...

8
00:01:11,599 --> 00:01:17,000
You held the watch... till morning came.

9
00:01:25,599 --> 00:01:30,500
Sleeping close... your messy hair.

10
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:35,349
Your broken ribs... from my despair.

11
00:01:35,549 --> 00:01:40,549
My madness struck... you took the fall.

12
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:47,000
Still you rest... against the shawl.

13
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:54,200
A living shield... against my storm.

14
00:01:54,250 --> 00:01:59,500
A quiet fire... within my chest.

15
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:04,780
To keep me safe... you bore the harm,

16
00:02:05,019 --> 00:02:10,219
Beside me now... in silent rest.

17
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:24,400
Gentle soul... I touch your sleeve.

18
00:02:24,699 --> 00:02:29,800
You faced the monster... in my mind.

19
00:02:30,199 --> 00:02:35,199
More than thanks... that I believe,

20
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:41,199
The truest heart... I'll ever find.

21
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:47,800
Open blue eyes... looking deep.

22
00:02:47,849 --> 00:02:53,129
No hate, no blame... as you awake.

23
00:02:53,270 --> 00:02:58,150
You gave your peace... to guard my sleep,

24
00:02:58,610 --> 00:03:04,310
The safest place... my heart could take.

25
00:03:06,500 --> 00:03:12,319
I draw my hand back... as you stir.

26
00:03:12,449 --> 00:03:17,479
Safe with you... until the dawn.

27
00:03:17,550 --> 00:03:23,349
The boy who held... my fragile world…

28
00:03:25,949 --> 00:03:36,500
Holds my fragile heart... and see me through...